# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# Canonical host is the apex (https://huskynotes.com/).
# 301 the www subdomain to the apex, preserving the rest of the path.
# Requires www.huskynotes.com to be added as a custom domain on the Pages project.
https://www.huskynotes.com/* https://huskynotes.com/:splat 301
